        <Replace Tag="LOC_CD_PRESSURE_TURNS" Language="zh_Hant_HK"><Text>依目前速度</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_CD_PRESSURE_TURNS_COUNT" Language="zh_Hant_HK"><Text>約{1_Turns}{1_Turns: plural other?回合;}</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_CD_TOAST_GAINED" Language="zh_Hant_HK"><Text>文化擴散：你的文化取得了新的領土。</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_CD_TOAST_LOST" Language="zh_Hant_HK"><Text>文化擴散：另一個文明奪取了你的一個格位。</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_CD_PRESSURE_READY" Language="zh_Hant_HK"><Text>即將易手</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_CD_PRESSURE_STALLED" Language="zh_Hant_HK"><Text>停滯</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_CD_PRESSURE_OWNER_SUFFIX" Language="zh_Hant_HK"><Text>（擁有者）</Text></Replace>
